Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; The game settings every harness run reads (WB16), in place of the user's registry: tests/verify/harness_settings.h.
; Both installs' trees: the original's (Nival Interactive) and Rebirth's (Gipat.Ru\EI_Starter: addon.dll and the
; image's Rebirth mode read their game settings from its EvilIslands key, the starter's switches from Settings).
; Taken from this machine's registry on 2026-10-20 (reg export), with the values that reproduce the goldens
; recorded before the user's play test of 2026-10-16: the original's General Settings\AudioStreaming 0x1c (the play
; set it 0: no streamed music, and the world's random draws differ), AudioSFX 0x1c and AudioSpeech 0x19 (as
; Rebirth's), Game Specific Settings\ShowTutorial 0 (docs/notes/standalone-verification.md, "Install files and
; registry"). A value or key a run reads that is not here fails the run; "name"=- and [-key] mark ones that are
; read but absent on purpose (the game takes its default). Work path / CD-ROM Path are replaced by the run's game
; folder (EI_GAME_ROOT, src/hook/paths.cpp); a scenario's resolution / widescreen / fullscreen / fpscursor /
; addonpath lines and CtfMon (always 0) are answered before this file (harness_starter.h).

